<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Moonlight Manor" description="Privacy information for visitors to the Moonlight Manor website.">
  <main><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1>Privacy<br/><em>policy.</em></h1></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="wrap content"><h2>Privacy policy preview</h2><p>This website preview does not currently collect or store personal information through an online booking form. Booking links direct visitors to third-party platforms, which operate under their own privacy policies.</p><p>If an enquiry form, analytics service or other data collection is added, this policy must be updated to explain what information is collected, why it is used, how long it is kept and how visitors can contact the responsible party.</p><p class="muted">This is draft website copy, not a final legal policy. The owner must review and approve it before launch.</p></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>